Trabalhos Futuros:
- The selection of parameters such as the number of sliding window sizes in neural networks is still somewhat subjective;

- The double-layer LSTM elements may not be able to fully explore the deep variation pattern information contained in nonlinear complex exponential sequences, so further research is needed to optimize model parameters;

- In feature extraction, further comparison and analysis can be conducted through different proportions of correlation.

- Lack of comprehensive stock information.

Problema de Pesquisa:
A avaliação de métodos de previsão em séries temporais financeiras apresenta limitações estruturais, como:
1. "Diversity Gap";
2. "Standardization Deficit";
3. "Real-World Mismatch".
